@startuml F5.9-D05-criar-periodo
title F5.9-D05 — Criar período letivo
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "CalendarController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Salvar período
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /academico/periodos
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: checar sobreposição\n(global, CA-06)
Postgres --> Ctrl: livre
Ctrl -> Postgres: INSERT período\n+ audit_log
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK (COMMIT)
Ctrl --> WebApp: 201
WebApp --> Sec: período no calendário

@enduml
